<title>BELGIUM: EU buys 20,835 tns beef into intervention stores.</title>
<headline>EU buys 20,835 tns beef into intervention stores.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union (EU) on Friday bought 20,835 tonnes of beef into intervention stores, roughly in line with the average weekly rate, Commission officials said.</p>
<p>Total trade offers to sell beef into intervention at a maximum price of 269.99 Ecus a tonne totalled 47,838 tonnes at the twice monthly EU tender.</p>
<p>--Brussels Bureau +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
